<title>HONG KONG: UBS sets call warrants on HSBC.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on HSBC.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland, Hong Kong Branch, said it launched 30 million American-style call warrants on shares of HSBC Holdings Plc.</p>
<p>Ten warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE	HK$165	   PREMIUM	 13 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE	 HK$2.145	 GEARING	 7.69x</p>
<p> EXPIRATION	  05.JAN.98	PAYDATE	 17.JAN.97</p>
<p> LISTING	     HONG KONG	LISTING DATE  22.JAN.97</p>
<p> REFERENCE SPOT    HK$165	   EXER LOT	4,000</p>
<p> MANAGER	     UBS Securities (HK) Ltd</p>
<p>			 Amsteel Securities (H.K.) Ltd</p>
<p>			 Vickers Ballas Hong Kong Ltd</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
</text>
